* DESIGN-PLAN planner-finish witness: a pattern function whose pattern carries ARBNO, so the graph is not uniform
        DEFINE('DIGS()')                         :(DEND)
DIGS    DIGS = ARBNO(ANY('0123456789') ' ') . R  :(RETURN)
DEND    S = '1 2 3 end'
        S POS(0) *DIGS() 'end'
        OUTPUT = '[' R ']'
        S = 'end'
        S POS(0) *DIGS() 'end'
        OUTPUT = '[' R ']'
END
